{"code":"246250","name":"에스엘에스바이오","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 2007년 신약개발 및 의약품 품질검사를 목적으로 설립되었으며, 2023년 코넥스에서 코스닥시장으로 상장함. 의약품 품질관리, 신약개발지원, 체외진단기기 사업을 하며, 식약처 지정 의약품 품질검사기관으로 300여 시험 서비스를 제공하고 있음. 신약개발지원 분야에선 신약 후보물질 효능평가, 비임상시험 서비스를 제공하고 체외진단 분야에선 알러지 신속진단키트를 개발하여 예방의학에 기여하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-22","n_days":300,"close":1969.0,"open":1969.0,"high":1969.0,"low":1969.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":0.0,"ma20":1969.0,"ma60":1969.0,"ma120":1969.0,"ma200":1969.0,"close_vs_ma200":0.0,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":0.0,"r2_250":0.0,"high52":1969.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":100.0,"dd_52w":0.0,"mdd_1y":0.0,"atr14_pct":64.2857,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":null,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":1.06,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-9.0,"op_margin_q":-69.2308,"op_qoq":10.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-28.5714,"rev_yoy":-18.75,"op_trend_4q":24.3137,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-64.25,"debt_ratio":68.21,"per":null,"pbr":5.13,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":1.06,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"246250","name":"에스엘에스바이오","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_code":"261","sector_nam